prompts.USER_PROMPT_TEMPLATE:
Extract flights from the attached aviation logbook image.

Important extraction rules:
- One table row = one flight.
- Do not invent rows.
- Do not complete doubtful fields.
- Use null for uncertain fields.
- Treat ditto marks or quote marks such as "", '', " ", or repeated quote-like marks in a cell as "same as above" for that column when the previous visible value is clear.
- For ditto/same-as-above cells, copy the nearest preceding visible value in the same column; if that value is not visible or is ambiguous, use null.
- Return only JSON.
- Spanish handwritten text may appear.
- Pay special attention to:
  - dates;
  - ICAO/location codes;
  - aircraft registration;
  - aircraft model;
  - departure and arrival times;
  - total flight time;
  - PIC name;
  - day landings;
  - remarks.

Image id: {source_image_id}
